# Vercel Web Analytics Installation Report

## Status: ✅ ALREADY CONFIGURED

Vercel Web Analytics is already fully installed and configured in this project as of PR #63.

## Current Implementation

### 1. Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` v2.0.1
- **Location**: Listed in `package.json` dependencies
- **Status**: ✅ Installed and up-to-date

### 2. Integration
- **Framework**: Next.js 16.2.9 (App Router)
- **Implementation File**: `frontend/src/app/layout.tsx`
- **Configuration**: Analytics component imported from `@vercel/analytics/next` and added to the root layout

### 3. Code Implementation
The Analytics component is correctly placed in the root layout:

```typescript
import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/next';

export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body className="min-h-screen">
        {/* Other providers */}
        <Analytics />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

This implementation follows the official Vercel Analytics quickstart guide for Next.js App Router projects.

